        "One antelope.",
        "    On riding round",
        "a little knoll, I",
        "saw two antelope a",
        "long distance off,",
        "looking at me; I",
        "dismounted and",
        "fired off hand, with",
        "careful aim, holding",
        "a foot over him, and",
        "breaking his neck",
        "near the shoulder. By",
        "actual measurement",
        "the distance was",
        "three hundred yards;",
        "the best shot I ever",
        "made with the rifle."
